@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊所负责人" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:维护日期排班与</u>\n<u>诊椅安排控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:日期安排</u>" as Schedule
participant "<u>:安排变更</u>" as ScheduleChange
participant "<u>:预约</u>" as Appointment
participant "<u>:诊后要求</u>" as Followup
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-15办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-15办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Schedule : 确认指定日期停诊(日期范围和原因)
activate Schedule
Schedule -> ScheduleChange : 保留日期例外(原安排及确认依据)
activate ScheduleChange
ScheduleChange --> Schedule : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate ScheduleChange
Schedule --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Schedule
K -> Appointment : 标记受影响安排(停诊范围和责任前台)
activate Appointment
Appointment --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Appointment
opt 受影响预约关联诊后要求
K -> Followup : 保留复诊待安排(受影响预约来源)
activate Followup
Followup --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Followup
end
K -> Appointment : 核对后续处理(通知、改约或取消结果)
activate Appointment
Appointment --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Appointment
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Followup
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
